<title>POLAND: Huta Ferrum SA steel maker Warsaw debut June 27.</title>
<headline>Huta Ferrum SA steel maker Warsaw debut June 27.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel maker Huta Ferrum SA will start trade on the main floor of the Warsaw stock exchange on June 27, the bourse's president Wieslaw Rozlucki said on Friday.</p>
<p>Ferrum's 33 million-zloty public offering in March was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
